      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### About this dashboard\nnf-core/ampliseq turns amplicon reads (16S, 18S or ITS) into amplicon sequence variants (ASVs), names each against a reference taxonomy and compares the communities of the samples. This page sums up one run; each tab behind it answers one question, in the order of the steps below.\n\nThe sample filters in the left panel apply to every tab: narrow the samples once and the whole dashboard follows. A bar above a section narrows that section only.\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": null,
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null
    },
    {
      "index": "ov-run",
      "component_type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "workflow_tag": "",
      "data_collection_tag": "",
      "wf_id": null,
      "dc_id": null,
      "dc_config": {},
      "cols_json": {},
      "parent_index": null,
      "last_updated": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### The run\n- ![](icon:mdi:flask-outline) **Samples** {{samples}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:dna) **Primers** {{param:FW_primer}} \u00b7 {{param:RV_primer}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:tag-outline) **Taxonomy** {{param:dada_ref_taxonomy}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:filter-remove-outline) **Removed** {{param:exclude_taxa}}\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": null,
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null,
