    {
      "index": "ov-steps",
      "component_type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "workflow_tag": "",
      "data_collection_tag": "",
      "wf_id": null,
      "dc_id": null,
      "dc_config": {},
      "cols_json": {},
      "parent_index": null,
      "last_updated": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### Six steps from reads to communities\nEach step names its settings and the tab that shows its result.\n\n::: steps\n1. ![](icon:mdi:content-cut) **Trim** Primers cut by Cutadapt \u00b7 [Settings](params:primer) \u00b7 [MultiQC](tab:MultiQC)\n2. ![](icon:mdi:dna) **Denoise** DADA2 infers the ASVs \u00b7 [Settings](params:trunc) \u00b7 [Phylogeny](tab:Phylogeny)\n3. ![](icon:mdi:tag-outline) **Classify** Against {{param:dada_ref_taxonomy}} \u00b7 [Settings](params:taxonomy) \u00b7 [Community](tab:Community & Diversity)\n4. ![](icon:mdi:chart-bell-curve) **Alpha** Diversity within samples \u00b7 [Settings](params:rarefaction) \u00b7 [Alpha](tab:Alpha Diversity)\n5. ![](icon:mdi:chart-scatter-plot) **Beta** Distances between samples \u00b7 [Settings](params:adonis) \u00b7 [Ordination](tab:Ordination & Clustering)\n6. ![](icon:mdi:scale-balance) **Test** ANCOM-BC between groups \u00b7 [Settings](params:ancombc) \u00b7 [Differential](tab:Differential Abundance)\n:::\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": "green",
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null
    },
